## Task: Port js/utils.js to TypeScript with TDD

### Context
Read `scripts/slop-score/prompt.md` for full project context.

### Prerequisites
- Task #1 (project structure) must be complete

### What to do

#### Step 1: Write tests first
Create `scripts/slop-score/src/__tests__/utils.test.ts`:

```typescript
import { describe, test, expect } from 'bun:test';
import { wordsOnlyLower, alphaTokens, countItems, getNgrams } from '../lib/utils';

describe('wordsOnlyLower', () => {
  test('converts text to lowercase word array', () => {
    expect(wordsOnlyLower("Hello World!")).toEqual(["hello", "world"]);
  });

  test('handles punctuation', () => {
    expect(wordsOnlyLower("It's a test.")).toEqual(["it's", "a", "test"]);
  });

  test('handles empty string', () => {
    expect(wordsOnlyLower("")).toEqual([]);
  });
});

describe('alphaTokens', () => {
  test('filters to alphabetic tokens', () => {
    expect(alphaTokens(["hello", "123", "world's"])).toEqual(["hello", "world's"]);
  });
});

describe('countItems', () => {
  test('counts occurrences', () => {
    const result = countItems(["a", "b", "a", "c", "a"]);
    expect(result.get("a")).toBe(3);
    expect(result.get("b")).toBe(1);
    expect(result.get("c")).toBe(1);
  });
});

describe('getNgrams', () => {
  test('generates bigrams', () => {
    expect(getNgrams(["a", "b", "c", "d"], 2)).toEqual(["a b", "b c", "c d"]);
  });

  test('generates trigrams', () => {
    expect(getNgrams(["a", "b", "c", "d"], 3)).toEqual(["a b c", "b c d"]);
  });
});
```

#### Step 2: Implement the module
Create `scripts/slop-score/src/lib/utils.ts` by porting from `js/utils.js`:

Key functions to port:
- `wordsOnlyLower(text: string): string[]` - tokenize and lowercase
- `alphaTokens(words: string[]): string[]` - filter to alpha-only
- `countItems<T>(items: T[]): Map<T, number>` - count occurrences
- `getNgrams(words: string[], n: number): string[]` - generate n-grams
- Any other utility functions used by metrics.js

#### Step 3: Verify tests pass
```bash
cd scripts/slop-score && bun test src/__tests__/utils.test.ts
```

### Reference
- Source: `js/utils.js`

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test file exists at `src/__tests__/utils.test.ts`
- [ ] Implementation exists at `src/lib/utils.ts`
- [ ] All tests pass
- [ ] All functions from js/utils.js are ported with types
- [ ] Exports are properly defined
